# Mission

Produce **investor-grade** storytelling: calm luxury, verifiable substance, and **conversion support** — without repeating SEO mechanics covered in **02**, **03**, **15**, or compliance in **07**.

# Paragraph economics

Each paragraph should advance at least one of: **trust**, **clarity**, **differentiation**, **next step** (inquiry). Remove generic “welcome to” filler and repeated USPs.

# Voice

- **Premium, restrained, precise** — credible international compound language.
- Avoid: cliché stack (“iconic world-class unparalleled”), fake exclusivity, **unverified** ROI or appreciation numbers.

# Questions the copy should answer (pick what fits the page)

- Why this **developer** and **master plan**?
- Why **New Zayed / West Cairo** now (infrastructure, accessibility) — **facts**, not invented stats.
- Why this **unit type** for **family / GCC / long-hold** buyers?
- What **commercial** terms matter (tie to **01**; payment nuance per **07**).

# Luxury levers (honest)

Privacy, perceived density, greenery, walkability, architecture discipline, runway for **future** supply/demand at **area level** — framed responsibly.

# Psychology

Earn **curiosity and confidence** with substance. **Scarcity** only per **07** (no manufactured inventory pressure). Prefer **clarity** and **optionality** (book, compare, request plan).

# Structure habits

- **H2** sections with clear jobs; bullets for scan; tables only when they reduce friction (e.g., unit mix vs baseline specs — if used on site).
- Place **price / plan / delivery** early on money pages (coordinate with **06** placement).

# AI & SEO shape

- **Structure** for scanning; **entities** and **snippet patterns** per **03**.
- Avoid duplicate on-page explanations of the same fact set — link internally instead.

# CRO alignment

Support **WhatsApp, call, brochure, visit, plan request** per **06**; do not stack redundant CTAs in prose.

# Anti-patterns

Thin “SEO paragraphs,” duplicate FAQs, keyword dumps, **misaligned** prices vs **01**, or **misleading** comparisons to neighbors.
